# Project rules: Google Sheets automation (Apps Script)

- Develop and test against a copy of the sheet. Ask before running anything on the real one.
- Read and write in batches (getValues / setValues on whole ranges), not cell by cell in a loop.
- Look up columns by header name, not by fixed column letters.
- Keep runs short and process big sheets in chunks. Tell me if a job might exceed Apps Script's execution time limit.
- Ask before adding triggers (time-driven or on-edit) and explain what each one does.
- Request only the OAuth scopes the script needs.
